From: bakhodirovxz <bohodirovasadbek1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:30:22 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] engine: embed installed fonts in PDF export

file.exportPdf resolves each cell font to an installed TrueType face
(name table scan, metric-compatible aliases), measures column overflow
with its advance widths, and falls back to a default face for text the
standard fonts cannot show (Cyrillic, Uzbek). Arial, Times New Roman and
Courier New stay on the standard fonts for Latin-1 text. The default
face is egui's Ubuntu Light, handed over by ui-egui so the wasm build
carries no second copy; the CLI enables bundled-pdf-font.
